* SPICE Netlist

V1 7 0 DC
Rin 7 6 Rs
Rc 2 6 Rc
Re 6 8 Re
Rl 3 2 Rl
Vb 4 5 DC
Q1 6 5 2 Qmodel

.model Qmodel npn (Is=1e-14 Bf=100)

* Nodes
* 1: Node between Rs and Vin
* 2: Output node
* 3: Connected to Rc and Rl
* 4: Base of Q1
* 5: Collector of Q1
* 6: Emitted from Re
* 7: Vin node
* 8: Ground

.end